      "section_id": "kohler-volume-2:p0437-p0440:s00:x00",
      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "                                     Boswellia Carterii Birdw.\n                                      Syn. Boswellia sacra Flückiger.\n\n              Weihrauchbaum — Encens, Oliban —                       Frankinsence or Luban-tree.\n           Familie:   Burseraceae; Gattung: Boswellia Roxb.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "乳香樹，漆樹科，學名 Boswellia Carterii，同義名 B. sacra。",
